- tests/x1/decks/Standard16-RG.dck and Standard16-UB.dck come from MageZero's XMage fork
  (https://github.com/WillWroble/mage, commit cb7e9c6fe2dcbe2f650a77dd98a87771e730f22f, Mage.Tests/decks/),
  MIT License (XMage's LICENSE.txt in that fork; MageZero itself is MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Will Wroble).
