  same license; X3 uses them for their face-down cards (disguise, face-down exile).
  tests/x3/decks/X3-FaceDown-UG.dck is Spellbench's own test list (foretell, disguise, manifest dread, cloak).
  The 16 standard-2022-25-bo1 decks of overlay/src/main/resources/mage/player/spellbench/catalog.json
  (Standard-Mono{B,G,R,U,W} and Standard16-{RG,UB,GB,RB,BW,UG,GW,UR,RW,UW,5C}) are the main decks of that fork's
  Mage.Tests/decks/ files at the same commit, under the same license.

- The 16 fdn-limited-bo1 decks of catalog.json (catalog ids FDN_top_*) are decks from 17lands' public FDN Premier
  Draft data (https://www.17lands.com/public_datasets), licensed CC BY 4.0
