  40 eval-split sample decks; only the main decks are used. Credit: 17lands and DraftZero.

- kit/xmage/src/mage/player/ai/ (the XMage agent kit) vendors XMage's MAD plugin
  (Mage.Server.Plugins/Mage.Player.AI.MAD: ComputerPlayer6, ComputerPlayer7, SimulatedPlayer2, SimulationNode2,
  SimulatedAction2, SimulationWorker2, Attackers2, mad/optimizers/, util/) and MCTS plugin
  (Mage.Server.Plugins/Mage.Player.AIMCTS, all 10 files) at the XMage pin, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2010
  betasteward@gmail.com. Each vendored file starts with an attribution line; the kit's changes are marked KIT and
