  kit/xmage/src/mage/player/ai/KitPayPlayer.java copies XMage ComputerPlayer's payment planner, as the engine's
  overlay/.../decide/AutoPayPlayer.java does, under the same license.

- The kit's world builder (kit/xmage/src/spellbench/kit/xmage/WorldBuilder.java) ports techniques of DraftZero's
  mzbridge StateInjector (https://github.com/danieljbrooks/draft-zero, java/mzbridge/, MIT License, Copyright (c)
  2026 Daniel Brooks): event-free injection, the turn position set by reflection, and trigger and event hygiene.
  Short recipes it ports are noted in the source.

